 | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, to find ${A}^{2},$ we multiply $A$ by itself:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{2} & =A\\cdot A \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since ${A}^{4}={A}^{2}\\cdot {A}^{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{4} & ={A}^{2}\\cdot {A}^{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}14 & -10 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}146 & -130 \\\\ 65 & -49\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186327555 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating a Matrix Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f0c2b3cc-f93c-501d-8056-141031180b88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f0c2b3cc-f93c-501d-8056-141031180b88" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327557} :answer-field/id #uuid "fdca023a-c0b2-5f2f-a00e-410b82ad7a8f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327556} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dd01be03-846d-509f-99cf-31223b7e25e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327559}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dd01be03-846d-509f-99cf-31223b7e25e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327559} :answer-field/id #uuid "d4ea2438-9281-5e8b-841f-bffef6d03718" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327558} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fbdd8b